# Store and check out every file byte for byte. The application pins SHA-256
# hashes of its rubric files (templates/rubrics/RUBRIC-LOCK.json) and its code
# is verified by fingerprint, so Git must never rewrite line endings, even
# where core.autocrlf is on (it is, at system level, on this PC).
* -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
